1
00:00:00,271 --> 00:00:02,751
(Raj:)On the off chance that Bernadette
doesn't call back and apologize,

2
00:00:02,807 --> 00:00:06,087
(Raj:)how do you feel about Mexican food
for dinner tonight?

3
00:00:06,143 --> 00:00:07,553
(Howard:)I don't know.
Sounds kind of heavy.

4
00:00:07,578 --> 00:00:10,578
(Raj:)That's 'cause you always fill up
on chips.

5
00:00:10,614 --> 00:00:13,064
(Amy:)And this is Dr. Gunderson
from Stockholm.

6
00:00:13,084 --> 00:00:14,624
(Sheldon:)Ah, Sweden.

7
00:00:14,752 --> 00:00:19,172
(Sheldon:)Home of my favourite Muppet
and second favourite meatball.

8
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:26,770
(Sheldon:)Okay, the Nordic reputation
for lack of humor is well-founded.

9
00:00:28,632 --> 00:00:30,942
(Sheldon:)Boy, is his name Gunderson
or No-Funderson?

10
00:00:33,104 --> 00:00:34,644
(Amy:)Where are we going with this,
Dr. Cooper?

11
00:00:34,672 --> 00:00:39,142
(Sheldon:)Please, I'm your boyfriend.
You call me Sheldon.

12
00:00:39,176 --> 00:00:42,126
(Penny:)That's right,
I am in a boy-girl relationship

13
00:00:42,146 --> 00:00:44,596
(Sheldon:)with this cute little lump of wool.

14
00:00:44,648 --> 00:00:47,648
(Penny:)-Sheldon...
-it's a physical relationship, too.

15
00:00:47,751 --> 00:00:51,201
(Sheldon:)Hand-holding, hugging...
even on hot days.

16
00:00:52,656 --> 00:00:53,826
Ow!

17
00:00:53,991 --> 00:00:55,261
Okay, here's a new ons.

18
00:00:55,326 --> 00:00:58,166
(Sheldon:)Apparently now we kick each other
in the shin under the table.

19
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:04,020
(Sheldon:)How do you like it
when I do it to you?

